### Page 1 of 1

```text
NOTICE OF PROPOSED TRADE OF REAL PROPERTY
COMES NOW the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, and pursuant to the provisions of Wyoming Statute Section
15-1-112(b)(ii), provides public notice of a proposed trade of real property owned by the City of Cheyenne,
described as Lot 4, Block 3, Griffin Addition to the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, encompassing 0.77 acres
and having an appraised value $275,000.00, for real property owned by Black Hills Energy, described as
Lots 5-8, Block 334, City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, plus the south half of the alley vacated with Resolution
No 1395, encompassing .85 acres and having an appraised value of $445,000.00. A public hearing of the
proposed trade of real property will be held by the Governing Body in the City Council Chambers at 2101
O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne WY 82001, on Tuesday November 12, 2024, at 6:00 P.M. The public is invited to
offer comments on the proposed trade of real property either in person at the meeting or by mailing
comments to the City Clerk, 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Cheyenne WY 82001.

Publish:
October 25, November 1, and November 8, 2024
```
